Subject: Re-render publication captures with a synthetic workspace

The publication PNGs were regenerated from the existing harness rather than
edited in place.  The temporary copy changed only the fixture path, output
filenames, and proof filename:

```diff
--- work/ui-model-panel-harness.mjs
+++ work/ui-model-panel-harness-public.mjs
@@
-const fixture = path.join(work, `ui-panel-harness-fixture-${randomUUID()}`)
+// Re-render publication assets with a synthetic, non-private project path.
+const fixture = '/private/tmp/harzva-supervisor-public-demo-v2'
@@
-const light = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-harness-light.png')
+const light = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-public-light.png')
-const stale = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-harness-stale.png')
+const stale = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-public-stale.png')
-const dark = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-harness-dark.png')
+const dark = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-public-dark.png')
-const mobileDark = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-harness-mobile-dark.png')
+const mobileDark = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-public-mobile-dark.png')
-const mobileLight = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-harness-mobile-light.png')
+const mobileLight = path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-public-mobile-light.png')
@@
-path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-proof.json')
+path.join(work, 'ui-model-panel-public-proof.json')
```

The temporary script was run with Node from the repository worktree and exited
successfully with `checks: 20` and `screenshots: 5`. The resulting assets were
copied into the package and evidence directories without raster post-processing.
